    "usage": "Only known flat numeric fields are totaled as reported; input and cache fields remain separate. Null means no known report, not zero. Usage-known requires both input and output. Partial reports contribute only present fields. Nested usage and failed generations with unavailable usage are omitted; totals are not complete billing totals or evidence of zero cost.",
